#: 425a83a5e7414e7e82f277ec34812c06
msgid "输出模块"
msgstr "Output Modules"

#: 0f243b1fa6364fa3ba1525e1f73afc92
msgid "基于边特征计算原子受力的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module for calculating atomic forces based on edge features."

#: 4550eee67e7d4e6bbc2b08c89d86386c
msgid ""
"该模块使用一个密集回归模型（`denseRegression`）来处理每条边的特征， 并将其预测的标量值沿着边的方向矢量投影，从而得到力矢量。 "
"最后，将所有作用到同一个原子上的力矢量进行汇总（scatter-add），得到每个原子的总受力。"
msgstr "This module uses a dense regression model (`denseRegression`) to process the features of each edge and projects the predicted scalar value along the edge's direction vector to obtain the force vector. Finally, all force vectors acting on the same atom are summed up (scatter-add) to get the total force on each atom."

