#: 3c8f2352d87c44faa33b33cf51cca9c0
msgid "基于节点标量和矢量特征计算原子受力的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module for calculating atomic forces based on node scalar and vector features."

#: 800bb5f7426a45b185b4ee5751ce7e51
msgid ""
"这个模块假设原子受力可以表示为一个标量部分和一个矢量部分的乘积。 如果节点特征维度大于1，则使用一个回归模型来计算标量部分； "
"否则，直接使用节点标量特征。"
msgstr "This module assumes that the atomic force can be represented as the product of a scalar part and a vector part. If the node feature dimension is greater than 1, a regression model is used to calculate the scalar part; otherwise, the node scalar features are used directly."

#: 5a7d6e597625494a8e45d301aa5902ed 5c9306722d2f4b6294b1c6d669b560b7
#: 5e12177f744d41eebab88443115862ba 7125ee6a1b494a6da3a9bf11fb2a514a
#: d278a88278ed42ae95a06e272568afb8 dd5d0e23c46b47efbde797d700a865d8
#: fd1f1038764c4d2b987224e3a1297321 fe6dece75f0943eda9c8bd07212d2edd
msgid "PyG 图数据对象。"
msgstr "PyG graph data object."

#: d64242d3b1d544d2adb757a41407c16e f9b19904dfe2453aaa41b4abcb3a0561
msgid "包含图表示的字典，需要 `node_attr` 和 `node_vec_attr`。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the graph representation, requiring `node_attr` and `node_vec_attr`."

#: 9a5d74dcfa13493bb53dcafa25acf191
msgid "计算得到的原子受力。"
msgstr "The calculated atomic forces."

#: 1d4613efae2646639b2b719e888767a9
msgid "计算 Born 有效电荷张量的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module for calculating the Born effective charge tensor."

#: 015672581e3a48fb81e87f6afd906188
msgid ""
"该模块通过组合二体（边）和三体（角）相互作用来计算每个原子的 Born 有效电荷张量。 二体项由边特征和边方向矢量的外积（张量积）构成。 "
"三体项（可选）由三元组特征和两个相关边的方向矢量外积构成。"
msgstr "This module calculates the Born effective charge tensor for each atom by combining two-body (edge) and three-body (angle) interactions. The two-body term is composed of the outer product (tensor product) of edge features and edge direction vectors. The three-body term (optional) is composed of the outer product of triplet features and the direction vectors of the two associated edges."

#: 731f12e2129e4e39a7ffdf8ab5e5f72a 7dbdeda9bc0f45159e92697f72ecb102
#: aaf5970fa75c4ac28309fadd7bc0cb04
msgid "包含图表示的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the graph representation."

#: dd63181db46946e793a180bc37c837df
msgid "每个原子的 Born 张量，形状为 (N_nodes, 9)。"
msgstr "The Born tensor for each atom, with a shape of (N_nodes, 9)."

#: 3e209eeb0ead4ed690c0b9a4742c91c2
msgid "基于节点标量和双矢量特征计算 Born 张量的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module for calculating the Born tensor based on node scalar and dual vector features."

#: 80fb3ed6ba294c759f945e95ff06ff05
msgid "此模块假设 Born 张量可以由节点上的两个基矢量（`node_vec_attr`）的 外积（张量积）与一个标量系数相乘得到。"
msgstr "This module assumes that the Born tensor can be obtained by multiplying the outer product (tensor product) of two basis vectors on the node (`node_vec_attr`) by a scalar coefficient."

#: c96cff87487d4a3983f11dfc729e5c63
msgid "计算得到的 Born 张量，形状为 (N_nodes, 9)。"
msgstr "The calculated Born tensor, with a shape of (N_nodes, 9)."

#: 9cecc0c68d7f4f828c85a595e9b17938
msgid "计算压电张量的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module for calculating the piezoelectric tensor."

#: 84a337cacfa74c4588632ae17230ba77
msgid "该模块通过组合二体和三体相互作用来计算压电张量。压电张量是三阶张量， 描述了材料在应变下产生极化的能力。计算涉及三阶的矢量张量积。"
msgstr "This module calculates the piezoelectric tensor by combining two-body and three-body interactions. The piezoelectric tensor is a third-rank tensor that describes the material's ability to generate polarization under strain. The calculation involves third-order vector tensor products."

#: f50117e73f564429966e216beddf4ac9
msgid "包含计算出的压电张量 `piezoelectric` 的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the calculated piezoelectric tensor `piezoelectric`."

#: 8fdb5f822dd2456496067c012a450b58
msgid "一个简单的标量预测模块。"
msgstr "A simple scalar prediction module."

#: c3ef9baa632a4f1ea36d84d42328aa70
msgid "该模块直接对节点特征进行全局池化（平均、求和或最大值）来预测一个标量属性。 它不包含任何可学习的参数，主要用于基线模型或简单任务。"
msgstr "This module directly performs global pooling (mean, sum, or max) on node features to predict a scalar property. It contains no learnable parameters and is mainly used for baseline models or simple tasks."

#: 59ec3d5017a944e2a307f78cc4d21321 b022965d281b489d8db96bf48ba913ac
#: b75e47a3b56849ff9a3f382b42fb6094
msgid "包含图表示的字典，需要 `node_attr`。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the graph representation, requiring `node_attr`."

#: 600de520b7d74ac795ebd2a0828dc1f1 65ac611ac5a042858b277644cc236b3d
msgid "包含预测标量 `scalar` 的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the predicted scalar `scalar`."

#: 115a8f3c7edb432f8a6ac887bc76d095
msgid "一个更复杂的标量预测模块，包含一个 MLP。"
msgstr "A more complex scalar prediction module that includes an MLP."

#: 8b09ec2d91874cdbb27194d6b394061a
msgid "该模块首先对节点特征进行全局池化，然后将得到的图级别特征 送入一个多层感知机（MLP）进行回归或分类。"
msgstr "This module first performs global pooling on node features, and then feeds the resulting graph-level features into a multilayer perceptron (MLP) for regression or classification."

#: 7013749626f54235b75c8148b71d49f9
msgid "计算晶体级别张量的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module for calculating crystal-level tensors."

#: e9a44b2385b84779a56488c0ff6a18f3
msgid "该模块包裹了 `Born` 模块，用于计算原子级别的张量。 然后，它可以选择直接返回原子级别的张量，或者通过平均池化 得到晶体级别的张量。"
msgstr "This module wraps a `Born` module to calculate atomic-level tensors. It can then choose to either return the atomic-level tensors directly or obtain a crystal-level tensor through average pooling."

#: 1be4f9f87d754f3da0353d370ad5dee3
msgid "包含 `atomic_tensor` 或 `crystal_tensor` 的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing either `atomic_tensor` or `crystal_tensor`."

#: 036e06b2b6c04271a855b94f50713ca5
msgid "同时预测总能量和原子受力的模块。"
msgstr "A module for simultaneously predicting total energy and atomic forces."

#: de62e8d00476412ca6a86e575536e43a
msgid "能量被计算为所有原子能量贡献的总和。力是通过对总能量关于原子位置 求负梯度得到的（依据海尔曼-费曼定理）。"
msgstr "Energy is calculated as the sum of all atomic energy contributions. Forces are obtained by taking the negative gradient of the total energy with respect to atomic positions (according to the Hellmann-Feynman theorem)."

#: fb7fc04537ce4b1b85eb60a2e6a7fe6b
msgid "包含 `forces` 和 `total_energy` 的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing `forces` and `total_energy`."

#: 7ca37ece09ec4977a8ca25f40371c751
msgid "计算电子-声子耦合 (Electron-Phonon Coupling, EPC) 矩阵的模块。"
msgstr "A module for calculating the Electron-Phonon Coupling (EPC) matrix."

#: fe9d68f4bffa403c93a26cc77f41b3c2
msgid ""
"这个类不是一个标准的 `nn.Module`，而是一个可调用的计算流程封装。 它接收一个图表示模型 (representation) "
"和一个哈密顿量输出模型 (output)， 通过自动微分计算哈密顿量对原子位移的导数，并结合波函数，最终计算出 EPC 矩阵。 EPC "
"矩阵描述了电子与晶格振动（声子）之间的相互作用强度，是计算材料 电导率、超导电性等关键物理量的核心。"
msgstr "This class is not a standard `nn.Module` but a callable wrapper for a computational workflow. It takes a graph representation model (representation) and a Hamiltonian output model (output). It calculates the derivative of the Hamiltonian with respect to atomic displacements via automatic differentiation and combines it with the wavefunctions to finally compute the EPC matrix. The EPC matrix describes the interaction strength between electrons and lattice vibrations (phonons) and is crucial for calculating key physical quantities like electrical conductivity and superconductivity."

#: a487cadd17d3417380544e2253c71159
msgid ""
"计算的核心是利用 `torch.autograd.functional.jacobian` 来获得雅可比矩阵 `nabla_HK` "
"(∂H(k)/∂R)，即 k 点哈密顿量相对于原子坐标 R 的梯度。"
msgstr "The core of the calculation is to use `torch.autograd.functional.jacobian` to obtain the Jacobian matrix `nabla_HK` (∂H(k)/∂R), which is the gradient of the k-point Hamiltonian with respect to the atomic coordinates R."

#: e868ac428afe4c25bf417d48b143a6bb
msgid "此类要求批处理中所有晶体的原子数量必须相等。"
msgstr "This class requires that all crystals in a batch have the same number of atoms."

#: b55ce1754fbc461798434d0a1cde31b5
msgid "GNN 模型，用于从原子结构数据计算图表示。"
msgstr "A GNN model for computing graph representations from atomic structure data."

#: 2a1cf39be49547138b30b0846c854387 7f4d54530f3d466fa9fed6e5bd12f0a4
#: b962ddac2a1b4ecdad43cf5187195f4f c29dac00534a427c99783085ff9eaa1b
msgid "type"
msgstr "type"

#: 55560b4bd9fe43e494026f1d839163df f3ad7545c50441389616d75fde8747ed
msgid "Callable"
msgstr "Callable"

#: 043c04e4716042bda17d0f3cf8a023d5
msgid "基于图表示计算哈密顿量 `HK`、重叠矩阵 `SK` 等物理量的模型。 该模型还需提供 `basis_def` 属性以定义原子轨道基组。"
msgstr "A model for calculating physical quantities such as the Hamiltonian `HK` and overlap matrix `SK` based on the graph representation. This model must also provide a `basis_def` attribute to define the atomic orbital basis set."

#: 857404a78bcc45f8a6624b39e7a215c3
msgid "计算 EPC 矩阵时所考虑的能带窗口的起始索引 (从 1 开始)。"
msgstr "The starting index (1-based) of the band window considered when calculating the EPC matrix."

#: 2992b8d878b7456b84b49a3cd3efc63e 80d5b680f4a541be9f68728364d11651
msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

#: dd71dc78bebb4a7591b52c5f5ccb9f51
msgid "计算 EPC 矩阵时所考虑的能带窗口的结束索引。"
msgstr "The ending index of the band window considered when calculating the EPC matrix."

#: 41a2251986744c7f8f9f10b5237ecb45
msgid "执行 EPC 矩阵的前向计算。"
msgstr "Performs the forward calculation for the EPC matrix."

#: 2e8a585ad05842928b05e9495fd8821e
msgid "PyG 图数据对象，包含原子坐标 `pos`、原子类型 `z`、晶胞 `cell` 等信息。"
msgstr "PyG graph data object, containing information such as atomic coordinates `pos`, atomic types `z`, and unit cell `cell`."

#: 0d6a680ce3bb47cdb4d71f4204d42206
msgid ""
"一个包含哈密顿量 `hamiltonian` 和 EPC 矩阵 `epc_mat` 的字典。       `epc_mat` 的形状为 "
"[N_batch, n_k, n_bands, n_bands, n_atoms, 3]。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the Hamiltonian `hamiltonian` and the EPC matrix `epc_mat`. The shape of `epc_mat` is [N_batch, n_k, n_bands, n_bands, n_atoms, 3]."

#: 0270f37d29f94d9f989af39d5151f5d1
msgid "一个包含哈密顿量 `hamiltonian` 和 EPC 矩阵 `epc_mat` 的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the Hamiltonian `hamiltonian` and the EPC matrix `epc_mat`."

#: 627057a619cc4db587375d55cf5f4297
msgid "`epc_mat` 的形状为 [N_batch, n_k, n_bands, n_bands, n_atoms, 3]。"
msgstr "The shape of `epc_mat` is [N_batch, n_k, n_bands, n_bands, n_atoms, 3]."